cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the NASA Harvest / Agmatix models it re-implements."
type: software
title: "Fast crop stage and crop cycle models"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-05"
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Meijian
    affiliation: "Columbia University & NASA GISS"
repository-code: "https://github.com/meijian-yang/fast-crop-stage-cycle"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Fast numba re-implementations of the NASA Harvest / Agmatix crop-cycle-detection
  and crop-stage-detection models, giving identical results about 65-650 times
  faster, plus a pipeline that maps crop cycle dates and weekly crop stage for corn
  and soybean at 30 m, 1 km and 9 km from Sentinel-2 + Landsat NDVI in Google Earth
  Engine.
keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - crop phenology
  - crop monitoring
  - NDVI
  - Sentinel-2
  - Landsat
  - Google Earth Engine
  - numba
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Crop Cycle Detection"
    authors:
      - family-names: Pelta
        given-names: Ran
    year: 2026
    url: "https://github.com/nasaharvest/crop-cycle-detection"
  - type: software
    title: "Crop Stage Detection"
    authors:
      - family-names: Pelta
        given-names: Ran
    year: 2026
    url: "https://github.com/nasaharvest/crop-stage-detection"
